      "value": "Thanks for your reply, Fax.\n\nTextMeshPro often does not allow Dynamic Batching because it has more vertex attributes when drawing the same string.\n\nThe maximum number of characters that can be Dynamic Batching is as follows\n\nTextMesh:75 characters\n\nTextMeshPro:32 characters",
